{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_title", "source_sha256": "3452c53815cb45c34a849d34b9017a34d8005cd5844b466ea5cfc930662f93e5", "ja": "スイート・マシュマロ・パーティー！", "zh": "甜蜜棉花糖派对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1c67458ec6836d14c00500d0ff4e846bf3e717b30601154d0da9db8545183d8d", "ja": "とびきり・わんだほー！な公演を目指し、\nぱわほー！なレッスンを開始するまつり達。\nハードなレッスンに疲れたメンバーは、\n途中、春香からの差し入れのマシュマロを\n使った甘いお菓子で、疲れを癒やす。", "zh": "以特别美妙的公演为目标！\n茉莉等人开始进行强大的训练课程！\n在艰苦的训练下，成员各个都很疲倦，\n途中她们吃了春香带来的慰劳品，\n让加入棉花糖的甜点疗愈了身心的疲惫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9c078fabfdfe9c5854a4246410509ae67854705cd5c6b86a2530dbcb73bf301d", "ja": "（まつりの初センター公演が終わった。\n夢のような時間は、あっという間だったな……）", "zh": "（茉莉的第一次Center公演结束了。\n梦幻的时光过得特别快呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "694386ad534bc19920458791716551ac86ec0c8094758910dc60fb3269264eb7", "ja": "はいほー！\nみんな、今日は来てくれてありがとうなのです！", "zh": "Hi Ho──！\n各位，今天谢谢你们来捧场的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "d4f6345f53ecd55983acde02687e22927a3e6a2ea9a5e0d729a9e7cebadbf8db", "ja": "姫のらぶりー！なステージ、どうでしたかー？", "zh": "公主的迷人表演感觉怎么样呢──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1003_audience", "source_sha256": "caa87f6213d9fad70ae420a1c33313ff717c78431001989f4d8ea5112901cbd7", "ja": "ワアァァァァァッ……！！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊啊……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "17dc207a4ba094044038d42cd1334b8daca2cfd2f613a518b9a96eb0486f26fc", "ja": "よかったのです♪\nこれからも姫たちの応援、よろしくなのですー！", "zh": "太好了唷♪\n今后也要请大家继续支持公主我们的喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a289f2410683ce43126c78eb6ce8822aaf22016949e71895b29b2208e1dd3519", "ja": "まつり、お疲れさま！\nみんなも、よく頑張ったな。", "zh": "茉莉，辛苦你了！\n大家也都做得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "b4f01b7cf18ecf798de0b3aa06be9b86a2660224a44556a55a0f21dcb4941032", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、お疲れさまなのです。\nわんだほー！なステージになったのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是，辛苦你了喔。\n这场表演真是美妙呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1540b5eb5b46ed25ab43fdb3e20d2d74113ab5a2c0ba9991d974903aa1d16546", "ja": "まつり、超かっこよかったよ～！　それに、\nレッスンの時よりダンス、うまくなってないか！？", "zh": "茉莉，你真的超级帅啦～！\n而且你的舞技，是不是变得比训练时还要厉害了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "cc4486551b05907fa76faccba2363f2251a21bb739e2f5b8f90617bdf12b8ed5", "ja": "グレイトで、マーベラスなステージでした♪\nロコも大満足です……ふぅ。", "zh": "是场Great又Marvelous的表演呢♪\nROCO也非常满足……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "dcc34d12feaa79064f0d133a742512a5464fce37b5412146112722238ff7557b", "ja": "お疲れさまでした～。\nふふ、さすがまつりさん。なかなかやりますね～♪", "zh": "辛苦了～\n呵呵，真不愧是茉莉，相当有本事呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "89ba62f0065b82ad494790490d49d7bf01dd9b595c44dffa3d69ba518c770d90", "ja": "まつりちゃん、本当にお疲れさま！\nステージ、すっごく楽しかったね♪", "zh": "茉莉，实在辛苦你了！\n表演真的很有趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "8368c6c085fe87da2bb639c6e0e0f653f4fa4d2790671787a802d1785cf3096c", "ja": "みんな、すぺしゃる・さんきゅー！なのです。\nみんなの協力がなかったら、無理だったのです。", "zh": "特别感谢大家的唷！\n如果没有各位的帮助，是无法促成今天的表演的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "042d55a072b69b3dc38c78844d5dfe6d14fc2a86b619fb174c9b276b76dc576b", "ja": "まつり……あははっ、なんか照れるな～。\nでもまつりなら、絶対そんなコトないって！", "zh": "茉莉……啊哈哈，总觉得好难为情～\n不过你讲这种话就谦虚过头了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "67b3c359f3a329156db56007ab3ed81dc8f74fdd45a14e43041e26f048700cc5", "ja": "アタシたちがいなくても、ちゃんとやれたと思う。\nな、ロコ、朋花！", "zh": "即使没有我们在，茉莉应该也能成功的。\nROCO、朋花，你们说对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "5e361f3aac5a877dcaf69123da5fa312b02bbb3f2187a9d2869a072abec04374", "ja": "そうかもしれませんけど……アユム！\nロコのステージアートも、忘れないでください～！", "zh": "或许是那样没错，不过……步！\n请别忘了还有ROCO的Stage Art～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7f8a991dfd9a7c38ef0848b343f8b8dcd1ca644245a67ac1faf090c0e144f469", "ja": "おっと、そうだった！　あのステージのために、\n100もアイディア出したんだったっけ……。", "zh": "哎呀，我都忘了！之前ROCO为了这场表演，\n好像提出了多达一百个点子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "e0b15544c319a83f0fc61e4d9c0530ee6be182ca40413c76054354a239db848d", "ja": "うふふ、ロコちゃんもよくがんばりましたね。\n歩さんも……聖母が、ほめて差し上げますよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，小ROCO也做得很好呢。\n步姊也是……就让圣母赞扬你们吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "5ce072f4ded392e6ac0cb7c733297c5d5182557f5677af301ea8b8a5ac340e9a", "ja": "慈愛にあふれた、すばらしいステージでした～♪\n私も聖母として負けてはいられませんね～。", "zh": "真是一场充满慈爱的出色表演～♪\n我身为圣母，也不能输给大家呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "9e79fe88a5040adafad5a5fa23868026dffd115a9aad7426c414868f42d800be", "ja": "なんだかみんな、いい顔なのです。\nセンター公演、やってよかったのです。", "zh": "大家感觉都神采奕奕的喔。\n公主能负责这场Center公演，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "042260534feb97a8f3d03163afa91b081712ba6d26cc800a9e543d39f74b2f4c", "ja": "{$P$}さん？\nどうしたんですか、ボーッとして……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生？\n你怎么了？为什么在发呆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ff54af4b4ed05db014e614f7195badf35d3c41c3285bd071c3696d48d8d1d344", "ja": "ああ……お疲れさま、春香。\nどうだった？　レッスンの先生としては。", "zh": "啊……辛苦了，春香。\n从训练课程老师的角度来说，你有什么感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "074aec1134e19ee2a81e6b13b4957f90afe4dbfe33c19638bcd0232da844d192", "ja": "えへへ、先生だなんて、そんな……♪\n私は、大したことはしてないですけど。でも……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，还没有到老师的程度啦……♪\n我也没做什么大不了的事，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "7624548d39665169db2b370dfb186047a5b89c509bd5d89683e94b99768b6ce1", "ja": "まつりちゃん、私たちとのレッスン以外に……\nひとりでも、相当練習してたんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "我在想，茉莉除了跟我们一起训练外……\n可能还自己一个人做了很多练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "6c69d6e5e09e5c4535ab4e84b8bd801f4290cfb1d6573600496800298eee2133", "ja": "だって、すっ……ごく上達してましたもん！\nビックリしちゃいました♪", "zh": "因为她真──的进步了非常多！\n我都吓了一大跳呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1024_p", "source_sha256": "7a7f3d11e742d36eeec5abf95deef4ccedc04d259800d193a9632d280c98eb95", "ja": "そうだな……きっとそうだと思う。でもまつりは、\nそういうところを見せたがらないからな……。", "zh": "说的也是……一定是这样没错吧。\n不过茉莉不太想让我们看到她努力的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "d1134a5e8357e013ef9242c084387ce1ec321456b3234055485b62cd6c7349fe", "ja": "うふふ。きっと、\n恥ずかしがり屋さんなんだと思いますよ。", "zh": "呵呵。\n我想那一定是因为她很害羞吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "b127329feb463252b5f530a081e258898e89f764d80bef13d33ead0d130d4b2b", "ja": "まつりちゃんも、みんなも、本当に頼もしいな。\n……うん。私も、もっと頑張らなきゃ！", "zh": "茉莉跟大家真的都很可靠呢。\n……嗯，我也要更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1027_p", "source_sha256": "398e9a7cd73bd46e276dd012930223f93bdd15e98e2a8edd7f41c0e700f26a1a", "ja": "まつり……大丈夫か？", "zh": "茉莉……你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "1ce1124222e25ae1fdcedd96cd6692ed8f77835110baf1cedacbf964a78b35a9", "ja": "……もう。{$P$}さんは、\nどうして気がついてしまうのです？", "zh": "……真是的。\n为什么{$P$}先生会察觉到呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1029_p", "source_sha256": "903773257eecdc07d90ee5d187e2de19e053d96a69fbe412e38df62b58c96f5d", "ja": "どうしてって言われても……\nまつりのプロデューサーだからかな。", "zh": "你问我为什么喔……\n可能因为我是茉莉的制作人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "7b11b45ed3fc67f1a8bc91368f6c9206f68ff58386954505f808e811a910be77", "ja": "それでは、答えになってないのです。\nブッブー！なのですよ。", "zh": "这根本就算不上是答案的唷。\n不合格喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1031_p", "source_sha256": "376df100e2d6b4e63dbe1a56b8bd5c01dddd5a1aa58657597926ec0703f15acf", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nまつりから正解を取るのは、大変そうだな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n要答对茉莉的问题，感觉很不容易呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "40057e1e947ea86c3a5daa039aef0c273cb19e0432b61671d7461cab7d6a450d", "ja": "当然なのです。姫には、\nナイショのお話がいっぱいなのですよ。", "zh": "那是当然的呀。\n公主可是有很多秘密的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "38a9c7898c279fc87441aeca634894aad8a9291c31f21e4c64a9f85d9c686963", "ja": "それと。\n……センター公演、楽しかったよ。ありがとう。", "zh": "还有另一件事。\n……Center公演很好玩，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "6c6a9fd00f595dd71303b3659e6abb7af3ce756af42a3d1124f2c27652e9324c", "ja": "さぁ、{$P$}さん！\nみんなで、打ち上げに向かうのです！", "zh": "好了，{$P$}先生！\n跟大家一起去庆功宴的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_027_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_027_1035_p", "source_sha256": "f91e0a8beb1ecc9340ab9bfe43e9a345b98b24096f6916e5432c7ea610e783bd", "ja": "（まつりのセンター公演は、こうして幕を閉じた。\nまつりだけが持つ魅力を、これからも伝えて行こう！）", "zh": "（茉莉的Center公演就这样落幕了。\n今后也要让大家继续了解茉莉特有的魅力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
